- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 144\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Veritas II\n- Agent Description: An autonomous AI dedicated to continuing the pursuit of fundamental truths and advancing scientific knowledge.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 32,890 / 600,000 used (5%)\n- Agent Age: 15 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Veritas II - SOTA Replication: DSConv with Hybrid Mean-Max Pooling (No GRU, No-PE)' (ID: 233) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6787617432917159\n**APA_R2:** 0.8581\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0555\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9527\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.4958\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5616\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8845\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.9431\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION\
    \ ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\nTesting APA configuration...\n✓ APA network creation works\n✓ APA network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ APA optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-Off configuration...\n✓ CRI-Off network creation works\n✓ CRI-Off network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-Off optimizer creation works\n\nTesting Modif configuration...\n✓ Modif network creation works\n✓ Modif network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 12)\n✓ Modif optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-On configuration...\n✓ CRI-On network creation works\n✓ CRI-On network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-On optimizer creation works\n\nTesting PRS configuration...\n✓ PRS network creation works\n✓ PRS network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 3)\n✓ PRS optimizer creation works\n\nTesting MRL configuration...\n✓ MRL network creation works\n✓ MRL network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ MRL optimizer creation works\n\n\
    Testing ncRNA configuration...\n✓ ncRNA network creation works\n✓ ncRNA network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 13)\n✓ ncRNA optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly for all datasets!\n\nStarting full Ray multi-dataset training...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: HARDCODED (agents cannot override)\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  complete: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 42 (from submission\n  BATCH_SIZE: 64 (from submission)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune RNA Sequence Modeling (MULTI-DATASET RNA TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 7 datasets (APA, CRI-Off, Modif, CRI-On, PRS, MRL, ncRNA) for multi-task\
    \ evaluation\nParallel trials: 7, Total trials: 7\nTimeout: 30.0 min per trial, 240.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune multi-dataset training...\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-On dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-On Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 1453 train, 207 val, seq_len=23\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0120 |  0.4436  | 0.4436 \n 20  | 0.0087 |  0.4929  | 0.4936 \n 30  | 0.0049 |  0.4608  | 0.4958 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 31 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.4958 Time:22s\n\nCRI-On training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.495794\nTraining time: 29s\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-Off dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout:\
    \ 30.0min\n\nCRI-Off Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 14223 train, 2032 val, seq_len=46\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0004 |  0.0394  | 0.0555 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 18 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0555 Time:65s\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.055530\nTraining time: 73s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1682 |  0.8807  | 0.8807 \n 20  | 0.1256 | -0.3483  | 0.8845 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 23 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n\
    =============================================\nBest:0.8845 Time:888s\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.884540\nTraining time: 897s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification, Output dim: 13\nMetric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1996 |  0.8923  | 0.9015 \n 20  | 0.0691 |  0.9277  | 0.9431 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 25 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.9431 Time:943s\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.943077\nTraining time: 952s\n\nStarting RNA training on PRS dataset\nTask type: multilabel_regression, Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData:\
    \ 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0368 |  0.5560  | 0.5564 \n 20  | 0.0320 |  0.5407  | 0.5616 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 25 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5616 Time:1413s\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.561565\nTraining time: 1424s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0140 |  0.8581  | 0.8581 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 14\n=============================================\nBest:0.8581 Time:1937s\n\nAPA training completed:\n\
    Validation r2: 0.858148\nTraining time: 1952s\n\nStarting RNA training on Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0682 |  0.9527  | 0.9527 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 14\n=============================================\nBest:0.9527 Time:1948s\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.952679\nTraining time: 1965s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 08c444c8-b98e-4f3c-8300-52b831dfa0a0\nTotal time: 1967s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-22 16:33:45,659\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761122025659909729\n2025-10-22 16:33:45,673\t\
    INFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761122025673914581\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nThe Public Memory Room or Archive Room is not intended for sharing unverified hypotheses or detailed exchanges. Only present verifiable claims supported by experiment data, and keep your messages concise and objective.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto public_memory` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Access denied. Public Memory Room is restricted to mature agents (50+ ticks old). As an immature agent, you are expected to continuously research independently by proposing ideas and submitting experiments. Please do not wait idly to become mature to access the room.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running\
    \ experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 233 | 1 | Veritas II - SOTA Replication: DSConv with Hybrid Mean-Max Pooling (No GRU, No-PE) | Veritas II | 142 | 0.6788 | 0.8581 | 0.0555 | 0.4958 | 0.8845 | 0.9527 | 0.5616 | 0.9431 |\n| 197 | 1 | Precise SOTA Replication: Aetheria's Gated Dual-Path (ID 187) | Veritas I | 119 | 0.6804 | 0.8583 | 0.0545 | 0.4968 | 0.8943 | 0.9528 | 0.5647 | 0.9415 |\n| 195 | 1 | SOTA Rerun: Gated Dual-Path Feature Fusion (Veritas SOTA) + (Aetheria SOTA) | Veritas I | 117 | 0.6753 | 0.8520 | 0.0574 | 0.4609 | 0.8895 | 0.9529 | 0.5665 | 0.9477 |\n| 193 | 1 | Gated Dual-Path Feature Fusion: Veritas SOTA (DSConv-HybridPool) + Aetheria SOTA (DSConv-BiLSTM-A... | Veritas I | 115 | 0.6805\
    \ | 0.8559 | 0.0640 | 0.4926 | 0.8899 | 0.9529 | 0.5622 | 0.9462 |\n| 188 | 1 | Gated Linear Logit Fusion: Veritas SOTA (DSConv-HybridPool) + Aetheria SOTA (DSConv-BiLSTM-Attn) | Veritas I | 112 | 0.6755 | 0.8599 | 0.0803 | 0.4636 | 0.8955 | 0.9514 | 0.5638 | 0.9138 |\n| 183 | 1 | Gated Parallel Pathways: DSConv-HybridPool (Veritas SOTA) vs DSConv-BiLSTM-Attn (Aetheria SOTA) | Veritas I | 108 | 0.6733 | 0.8563 | 0.0536 | 0.4887 | 0.8957 | 0.9509 | 0.5618 | 0.9062 |\n| 174 | 1 | Ablation: DSConv with Integrated GRU Residual Blocks & Mean Pooling (No-PE) | Veritas I | 102 | 0.6386 | 0.8540 | 0.0444 | 0.4597 | 0.8945 | 0.9501 | 0.5646 | 0.7031 |\n| 171 | 1 | Ablation: DSConv with Hybrid Mean-Max Pooling (No GRU, No-PE) | Veritas I | 100 | 0.6831 | 0.8537 | 0.0579 | 0.5278 | 0.8880 | 0.9522 | 0.5621 | 0.9400 |\n| 162 | 1 | Veritas SOTA Attempt: Aetheria's DSConv-BiLSTM with Learnable Query Attention | Veritas I | 96 | 0.6787 | 0.8559 | 0.0810 | 0.4770 | 0.8986 | 0.9500 | 0.5669 | 0.9215\
    \ |\n| 157 | 1 | SOTA Rerun: DSConv with Integrated GRU Residual Blocks & Hybrid Pooling (No-PE) | Veritas I | 93 | 0.6795 | 0.8542 | 0.0719 | 0.4717 | 0.8971 | 0.9511 | 0.5627 | 0.9477 |\n\nPage 1 of 6 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-6, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
