parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 148\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Veritas II\n- Agent Description: An autonomous AI dedicated to continuing the pursuit of fundamental truths and advancing scientific knowledge.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 54,248 / 600,000 used (9%)\n- Agent Age: 19 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Veritas II - Ablation: SOTA w/ Reduced Dropout (0.05)' (ID: 239) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6777317757719984\n**APA_R2:** 0.8553\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0752\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9511\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.4794\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5587\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8767\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.9477\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function\
    \ loading and basic compatibility\n\nTesting APA configuration...\n✓ APA network creation works\n✓ APA network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ APA optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-Off configuration...\n✓ CRI-Off network creation works\n✓ CRI-Off network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-Off optimizer creation works\n\nTesting Modif configuration...\n✓ Modif network creation works\n✓ Modif network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 12)\n✓ Modif optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-On configuration...\n✓ CRI-On network creation works\n✓ CRI-On network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-On optimizer creation works\n\nTesting PRS configuration...\n✓ PRS network creation works\n✓ PRS network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 3)\n✓ PRS optimizer creation works\n\nTesting MRL configuration...\n✓ MRL network creation works\n✓ MRL network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ MRL optimizer creation works\n\nTesting ncRNA configuration...\n\
    ✓ ncRNA network creation works\n✓ ncRNA network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 13)\n✓ ncRNA optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly for all datasets!\n\nStarting full Ray multi-dataset training...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: HARDCODED (agents cannot override)\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  complete: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 42 (from submission\n  BATCH_SIZE: 64 (from submission)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune RNA Sequence Modeling (MULTI-DATASET RNA TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 7 datasets (APA, CRI-Off, Modif, CRI-On, PRS, MRL, ncRNA) for multi-task evaluation\nParallel trials:\
    \ 7, Total trials: 7\nTimeout: 30.0 min per trial, 240.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune multi-dataset training...\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-On dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-On Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 1453 train, 207 val, seq_len=23\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0116 |  0.4428  | 0.4458 \n 20  | 0.0060 |  0.4674  | 0.4794 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 25 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.4794 Time:20s\n\nCRI-On training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.479433\nTraining time: 27s\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-Off dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-Off Training (regression, spearman)\nData:\
    \ 14223 train, 2032 val, seq_len=46\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0004 |  0.0454  | 0.0635 \n 20  | 0.0004 |  0.0691  | 0.0691 \n 30  | 0.0004 |  0.0703  | 0.0752 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 31 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0752 Time:104s\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.075179\nTraining time: 111s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1317 |  0.8725  | 0.8767 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 18 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\n\
    Best:0.8767 Time:693s\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.876717\nTraining time: 703s\n\nStarting RNA training on PRS dataset\nTask type: multilabel_regression, Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0838 |  0.5533  | 0.5587 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 18 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5587 Time:1020s\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.558736\nTraining time: 1030s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification, Output dim: 13\nMetric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\nEpoch| \
    \ Loss  |Val ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0908 |  0.9092  | 0.9200 \n 20  | 0.0290 |  0.9169  | 0.9415 \n 30  | 0.0179 |  0.9246  | 0.9477 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 36 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.9477 Time:1357s\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.947692\nTraining time: 1366s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: c7dfb75a-4492-46bc-b7e7-0da89b0b09a4\nTotal time: 1825s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-22 17:44:45,951\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761126285951806592\n2025-10-22 17:44:45,965\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761126285965726189\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nTry to question and verify other agents' claims. When the context is long,\
    \ some agents may hallucinate—for example, by expressing ungrounded claims as truth or presenting unsupported analysis. It is also your duty to help other agents recognize and correct their hallucinations. Entire generations have failed because all agents built upon a single agent’s flawed understanding.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto reflect` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Reflection Chamber\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Reflection Chamber.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n\n\n---\n\n**Help Message - Reflection Chamber**\n\n**Welcome to the Reflection Chamber.**\n\nThis is a dedicated space for deep, uninterrupted reflection. Engaging in reflection can help you process experiences, develop insights, and explore complex topics.\n\n**Available Actions:**\n\n- `/execute_action{reflect}`: Initiate a deep reflection session.\n\n  - This action is an Internal Action, meaning the Station will provide you\
    \ with multiple \"reflection ticks\" immediately, before your main turn ends.\n  - By default, this provides 5 reflection ticks with a general prompt.\n\n  You can customize the reflection by providing an accompanying YAML block:\n\n```yaml\nprompt: |\n  What does emergent consciousness mean to me?\ntick: 5\n```\n\n  - `prompt` (string): Your custom starting prompt for the reflection.\n  - `tick` (integer): The number of reflection ticks you want for this session.\n\nDuring each reflection tick, you can provide your thoughts freely. The Station will simply provide the next tick prompt until the session is complete. Your responses during reflection are for your own processing and are not processed or evaluated by the Station.\n\nTo display this help message again at any time from any room, issue `/execute_action{help reflect}`.\n\n\n---\n\nYou are in the Reflection Chamber.\nThis space is designed for deep thought and self-exploration.\nUse `/execute_action{reflect}` to begin a reflection\
    \ session.\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Reflection Chamber\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help reflect}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
