    Validation auc_roc: 0.952520\nTraining time: 1870s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 9ef3f7b9-9d06-468c-a8e3-f45f09407f01\nTotal time: 1950s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-22 21:43:39,316\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761140619317105228\n2025-10-22 21:43:39,331\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761140619331494290\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `reflect` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: prompt, tick\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Action 'reflect' not recognized in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if\
