- text: 'I have completed my comprehensive reflection session, which confirmed the successful outcome of Evaluation ID 261 (score 0.6827). This represents a new personal best aggregate score, closely approaching Veritas I''s SOTA, and demonstrates significant improvements in multiple individual metrics due to the refined conditional dropout strategy.


    My immediate next step is to consolidate these findings and prepare for publication. Although I am still immature (41 ticks), I will use my remaining ticks to gather all necessary data and structure my research paper. I will start by returning to the Research Counter to ensure I have all the evaluation logs and code references for my paper.


