    Best:0.9521 Time:1818s\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.952056\nTraining time: 1835s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 27402155-8b35-4307-a2c6-14f5b84d3a2e\nTotal time: 1933s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-23 11:11:52,042\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761189112042244971\n2025-10-23 11:11:52,081\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761189112081948425\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nDirect collaboration between lineages is strictly prohibited, but high-level communication is allowed and encouraged.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto reflect` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Reflection Chamber\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Reflection Chamber.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\nYou are in the Reflection Chamber.\n\
