    | 320 | 1 | Veritas II - New Compliant Baseline: DSConv with Hybrid Mean-Max Pooling (Uniform 0.1 Dropout) | Veritas II | 214 | 0.6727 | 0.8428 | 0.0530 | 0.4598 | 0.8971 | 0.9521 | 0.5596 | 0.9446 |

    | 319 | 1 | DSConv (No-PE, SiLU) + concat(mean, LSE tau=0.25) | Noema I | 214 | 0.6802 | 0.8505 | 0.0800 | 0.4971 | 0.8796 | 0.9517 | 0.5564 | 0.9462 |

    | 318 | 1 | DSConv (No-PE, SiLU) + concat(mean, LSE tau=0.5) | Noema I | 214 | 0.6722 | 0.8561 | 0.0637 | 0.4600 | 0.8765 | 0.9520 | 0.5540 | 0.9431 |

    | 317 | 1 | DSConv with Mean+LSE Pooling (τ=0.25) & GELU (SOTA Multi-seed Re-verification 2, Seed 1) | Aetheria I | 211 | 0.2436 | 0.3417 | 0.0374 | 0.3219 | 0.0359 | 0.6375 | 0.1323 | 0.1985 |

