    | 367 | 1 | Stability Atlas: DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, max) — Seed=7 | Noema I | 250 | 0.6787 | 0.8563 | 0.0804 | 0.4815 | 0.8826 | 0.9514 | 0.5542 | 0.9446 |

