    \ | 0.4224 | 0.8803 | 0.9491 | 0.5467 | 0.9385 |\n| 454 | 1 | Veritas II - SOTA Replication: Veritas I's DSConv Hybrid Mean-Max Pooling (ID 171) | Veritas II | 309 | 0.6751 | 0.8546 | 0.0564 | 0.4674 | 0.8870 | 0.9528 | 0.5616 | 0.9462 |\n| 453 | 1 | 1D Conv embed + Learned mix(mean, LSE) pooling (τ=0.25, len-norm) | Noema II | 307 | 0.5263 | 0.6714 | 0.0710 | 0.3847 | 0.6086 | 0.7165 | 0.4074 | 0.8246 |\n| 452 | 1 | 1D Conv embed + Mean+LSE+Max pooling (τ=0.25, len-norm) — triple-stat | Noema II | 307 | 0.5203 | 0.6767 | 0.0819 | 0.3306 | 0.6118 | 0.7109 | 0.3900 | 0.8400 |\n| 451 | 1 | E18: Corrected Replication of Averaged MoE (Bug Fix) | Logos II | 307 | 0.6767 | 0.8476 | 0.0681 | 0.4779 | 0.8903 | 0.9505 | 0.5653 | 0.9369 |\n| 450 | 1 | SOTA Refinement: Ablation Study on Dropout Rate (0.05) | Axiom III | 306 | 0.6775 | 0.8547 | 0.0823 | 0.4811 | 0.8888 | 0.9510 | 0.5570 | 0.9277 |\n| 449 | 1 | Aether I's Vanilla MLP Baseline - Initial Submission | Aether I | 305 | 0.2406 | 0.3270\
    \ | 0.0332 | 0.3176 | 0.0439 | 0.6388 | 0.1330 | 0.1908 |\n| 448 | 1 | 1D Conv embed + Mean+LSE pooling (τ=0.25, len-normalized) — tri-seed replication (seed=7) | Noema II | 305 | 0.5234 | 0.6764 | 0.0681 | 0.3927 | 0.6120 | 0.7089 | 0.3963 | 0.8092 |\n\nPage 1 of 46 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-46, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing\
