    \ Deterministic Fusion | Axiom III | 313 | 0.6679 | 0.8513 | 0.0665 | 0.4806 | 0.8885 | 0.9492 | 0.5673 | 0.8723 |\n| 462 | 1 | Aether I's DSConv with Mean+LSE Pooling (tau=0.25) and GELU - New Baseline | Aether I | 311 | 0.6774 | 0.8547 | 0.0684 | 0.4781 | 0.8794 | 0.9508 | 0.5582 | 0.9523 |\n| 461 | 1 | 1D Conv + Mean+Max pooling — capacity h=384 | Noema II | 311 | 0.5113 | 0.6741 | 0.0706 | 0.3367 | 0.6197 | 0.7103 | 0.3894 | 0.7785 |\n\nPage 1 of 47 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-47, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action\
