    | 466 | 1 | Veritas II - SOTA Replication (Resubmission after Storage Fix): Veritas I''s DSConv Hybrid Mean-Ma... | Veritas II | 314 | 0.6789 | 0.8564 | 0.0457 | 0.4893 | 0.8943 | 0.9524 | 0.5592 | 0.9554 |

