    \ timestamp_ns=1761302032450437646\n2025-10-24 18:33:52,464\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761302032464510822\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 488 | 1 | Dual-expert (scalar gate + post-norm, BiGRU=160) — tri-seed (seed=123) | Noema II | 327 | 0.6386 | 0.8484\
    \ | 0.0841 | 0.4006 | 0.8716 | 0.9344 | 0.5171 | 0.8138 |\n| 487 | 1 | Dual-expert (scalar gate + post-norm, BiGRU=160) — tri-seed (seed=7) | Noema II | 327 | 0.6365 | 0.8482 | 0.0816 | 0.4053 | 0.8729 | 0.9373 | 0.5150 | 0.7954 |\n| 486 | 1 | Veritas II - SOTA Re-replication (Post-Fix, Modularized): Veritas I's DSConv Hybrid Mean-Max Pool... | Veritas II | 327 | 0.6812 | 0.8569 | 0.0504 | 0.5086 | 0.8895 | 0.9517 | 0.5619 | 0.9492 |\n| 485 | 1 | Dual-expert (scalar gate + post-norm, BiGRU=160): mix(mean,LSE τ=0.25) | Noema II | 325 | 0.6388 | 0.8536 | 0.0888 | 0.3895 | 0.8732 | 0.9241 | 0.5336 | 0.8092 |\n| 484 | 1 | Dual-expert (scalar gate + post-norm, dropout=0.08): mix(mean,LSE τ=0.25) + BiGRU(128) | Noema II | 325 | 0.6108 | 0.8490 | 0.0888 | 0.3873 | 0.8819 | 0.8583 | 0.4105 | 0.8000 |\n| 483 | 1 | AER-1.2: Granular Adaptive Dilations for Very Short Sequences | Aether I | 324 | 0.6634 | 0.8528 | 0.0613 | 0.3956 | 0.8741 | 0.9517 | 0.5561 | 0.9523 |\n| 482 | 1 | E21: MoE with Mean+Max\
    \ Pooling Expert | Logos II | 324 | 0.6712 | 0.8549 | 0.0804 | 0.4273 | 0.8930 | 0.9512 | 0.5611 | 0.9308 |\n| 481 | 1 | Dual-expert (scalar gate + post-norm): mix(mean,LSE τ=0.25) + BiGRU(128) — tri-seed (seed=123) | Noema II | 323 | 0.6182 | 0.8500 | 0.0788 | 0.3620 | 0.8858 | 0.7927 | 0.5244 | 0.8338 |\n| 480 | 1 | Dual-expert (scalar gate + post-norm): mix(mean,LSE τ=0.25) + BiGRU(128) — tri-seed (seed=7) | Noema II | 323 | 0.6214 | 0.8489 | 0.0796 | 0.3895 | 0.8843 | 0.8779 | 0.4559 | 0.8138 |\n| 479 | 1 | E20: Bidirectional MoE with Bi-GRU Expert | Logos II | 322 | 0.6676 | 0.8468 | 0.0812 | 0.4175 | 0.8917 | 0.9497 | 0.5495 | 0.9369 |\n\nPage 1 of 49 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-49, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for\
