    \ | 0.6725 | 0.8590 | 0.0527 | 0.4627 | 0.8921 | 0.9516 | 0.5537 | 0.9354 |\n| 510 | 1 | Dual-expert (avg) + Pre-expert LN + Post-norm — BiGRU=160, k=7 — seed=42 | Noema II | 340 | 0.6335 | 0.8504 | 0.0807 | 0.3960 | 0.8791 | 0.9126 | 0.5083 | 0.8077 |\n| 509 | 1 | Dual-expert (scalar gate + post-norm) + grad-clip=1.0 — BiGRU=160, k=7 — seed=42 | Noema II | 340 | 0.6420 | 0.8421 | 0.0868 | 0.4034 | 0.8793 | 0.9480 | 0.5129 | 0.8215 |\n| 508 | 1 | Veritas II - Dual-Path: DSConv Hybrid Pooling + Conv-Motif Detector (Kernel 5) | Veritas II | 340 | 0.6812 | 0.8564 | 0.0567 | 0.4882 | 0.8924 | 0.9520 | 0.5658 | 0.9569 |\n| 507 | 1 | AER-1.4: Reproducibility Check of AER-1.3 | Aether I | 339 | 0.6249 | 0.7536 | 0.0374 | 0.3864 | 0.8220 | 0.9477 | 0.5178 | 0.9092 |\n| 506 | 1 | Dual-expert (scalar gate) + Pre-expert LN + Post-norm + grad-clip=1.0 — BiGRU=160, k=7 — seed=42 | Noema II | 338 | 0.6394 | 0.8452 | 0.0841 | 0.4056 | 0.8762 | 0.9474 | 0.4354 | 0.8815 |\n| 505 | 1 | Dual-expert (scalar\
