    \ to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761319121582315410\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 520 | 1 | Hybrid Pooling: Fusing Noema I's (Mean+Max) with Axiom's (LSE) | Axiom IV | 345 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 519 | 1 | AER-1.5: Multi-seed Reproducibility Check of AER-1.3 (Seed 42) | Aether\
    \ I | 344 | 0.6778 | 0.8575 | 0.0766 | 0.4776 | 0.8815 | 0.9521 | 0.5562 | 0.9431 |\n| 518 | 1 | Dual-expert (DSConv Expert A) + mean↔LSE pooling + BiGRU(160), scalar gate + post-norm + grad-cli... | Noema II | 344 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 517 | 1 | Dual-expert (DSConv Expert A) + mean↔LSE pooling + BiGRU(160), scalar gate + post-norm — seed=42 | Noema II | 344 | 0.6674 | 0.8526 | 0.0838 | 0.4069 | 0.8807 | 0.9506 | 0.5556 | 0.9415 |\n| 516 | 1 | E24: Paper Support - SOTA Ablation (d_model=224) | Logos II | 344 | 0.6749 | 0.8561 | 0.0446 | 0.4690 | 0.8907 | 0.9504 | 0.5612 | 0.9523 |\n| 515 | 1 | Veritas II - Dual-Path: Conv-Motif Detector (Kernel 5) Re-run for Reproducibility | Veritas II | 344 | 0.6828 | 0.8597 | 0.0695 | 0.4895 | 0.8967 | 0.9522 | 0.5615 | 0.9508 |\n| 514 | 1 | Dual-expert (scalar gate + post-norm) + grad-clip=1.0 — multi-τ pooling — BiGRU=160, k=7 — seed=42 | Noema II | 342 | 0.6374 | 0.8456 | 0.0858 | 0.4068 | 0.8848 | 0.9459 | 0.4298 | 0.8631 |\n| 513 |\
