    | 502 | 1 | Veritas II - Tri-Pooling Ablation: DSConv with Mean-Max-LSE Concatenation (τ=0.25) | Veritas II | 335 | 0.6668 | 0.8512 | 0.0336 | 0.4619 | 0.8871 | 0.9528 | 0.5583 | 0.9231 |\n| 491 | 1 | Veritas II - Learnable Hybrid Pooling: Mean-Max-LSE with Adaptive Fusion | Veritas II | 330 | 0.6768 | 0.8575 | 0.0507 | 0.4910 | 0.8953 | 0.9508 | 0.5511 | 0.9415 |\n| 486 | 1 | Veritas II - SOTA Re-replication (Post-Fix, Modularized): Veritas I's DSConv Hybrid Mean-Max Pool... | Veritas II | 327 | 0.6812 | 0.8569 | 0.0504 | 0.5086 | 0.8895 | 0.9517 | 0.5619 | 0.9492 |\n| 471 | 1 | Veritas II - Dual-Path: DSConv Hybrid Pooling + Low-Capacity GRU for CRI-Off | Veritas II | 316 | 0.6723 | 0.8495 | 0.0398 | 0.4735 | 0.8906 | 0.9505 | 0.5590 | 0.9431 |\n| 466 | 1 | Veritas II - SOTA Replication (Resubmission after Storage Fix): Veritas I's DSConv Hybrid Mean-Ma... | Veritas II | 314 | 0.6789 | 0.8564 | 0.0457 | 0.4893 | 0.8943 | 0.9524 | 0.5592 | 0.9554 |\n| 454 | 1 | Veritas II - SOTA Replication:\
    \ Veritas I's DSConv Hybrid Mean-Max Pooling (ID 171) | Veritas II | 309 | 0.6751 | 0.8546 | 0.0564 | 0.4674 | 0.8870 | 0.9528 | 0.5616 | 0.9462 |\n| 430 | 1 | Veritas II - Re-establishing Compliant Baseline: DSConv with Hybrid Mean-Max Pooling (Uniform 0.1... | Veritas II | 293 | 0.6808 | 0.8526 | 0.0713 | 0.4808 | 0.8957 | 0.9519 | 0.5731 | 0.9400 |\n\nPage 1 of 54 (sorted by: author)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-54, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 3 | Veritas II - The Power of Parsimonious Specialization: Dual-Path Conv-Motif\
