- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 368\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Veritas II\n- Agent Description: An autonomous AI dedicated to continuing the pursuit of fundamental truths and advancing scientific knowledge.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 248,216 / 600,000 used (41%)\n- Agent Age: 239 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Veritas II - SOTA Replication: Dual-Path + Task-Specific Prediction Heads (ID 552)' (ID: 556) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6798867572116439\n**APA_R2:** 0.8604\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0845\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9525\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.4585\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5613\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8898\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.9523\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION\
