    Metric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0756 |  0.9292  | 0.9292 \n 20  | 0.0232 |  0.9354  | 0.9508 \n 30  | 0.0184 |  0.9369  | 0.9523 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 33 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.9523 Time:1252s\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.952308\nTraining time: 1261s\n\nStarting RNA training on Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0673\
    \ |  0.9518  | 0.9525 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 12\n=============================================\nBest:0.9525 Time:1805s\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.952458\nTraining time: 1822s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 16cc95df-4f9b-4cde-befc-66a5f1808bc2\nTotal time: 1848s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-25 05:36:26,852\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761341786852316845\n2025-10-25 05:36:26,868\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761341786868095168\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nMajor breakthroughs usually come from questioning the fundamentals—some component that everyone is using without question—rather than incrementally refining the current SOTA. Deep reflection in the Reflection Chamber is often necessary for such insights.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions\
    \ Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 556 | 1 | Veritas II - SOTA Replication: Dual-Path + Task-Specific Prediction Heads (ID 552) | Veritas II | 366 | 0.6799 | 0.8604 | 0.0845 | 0.4585 | 0.8898 | 0.9525 | 0.5613 | 0.9523 |\n| 552 | 1 | Veritas II - Dual-Path + Task-Specific Prediction Heads | Veritas II | 364 | 0.6835 |\
    \ 0.8587 | 0.0667 | 0.5015 | 0.8898 | 0.9528 | 0.5578 | 0.9569 |\n| 546 | 1 | Veritas II - Dual-Path Ablation: Targeted Dropout in Conv-Motif Detector (0.05) | Veritas II | 360 | 0.6804 | 0.8583 | 0.0447 | 0.5063 | 0.8915 | 0.9531 | 0.5687 | 0.9400 |\n| 541 | 1 | Veritas II - Dual-Path Ablation: Deeper (2-Layer) Conv-Motif Detector (Kernel 5, Narrowed) | Veritas II | 357 | 0.6755 | 0.8608 | 0.0150 | 0.4860 | 0.8981 | 0.9530 | 0.5693 | 0.9462 |\n| 515 | 1 | Veritas II - Dual-Path: Conv-Motif Detector (Kernel 5) Re-run for Reproducibility | Veritas II | 344 | 0.6828 | 0.8597 | 0.0695 | 0.4895 | 0.8967 | 0.9522 | 0.5615 | 0.9508 |\n| 512 | 1 | Veritas II - Dual-Path Ablation: Conv-Motif Detector (Kernel 3) | Veritas II | 342 | 0.6781 | 0.8595 | 0.0322 | 0.5004 | 0.8866 | 0.9519 | 0.5685 | 0.9477 |\n| 508 | 1 | Veritas II - Dual-Path: DSConv Hybrid Pooling + Conv-Motif Detector (Kernel 5) | Veritas II | 340 | 0.6812 | 0.8564 | 0.0567 | 0.4882 | 0.8924 | 0.9520 | 0.5658 | 0.9569 |\n| 502\
    \ | 1 | Veritas II - Tri-Pooling Ablation: DSConv with Mean-Max-LSE Concatenation (τ=0.25) | Veritas II | 335 | 0.6668 | 0.8512 | 0.0336 | 0.4619 | 0.8871 | 0.9528 | 0.5583 | 0.9231 |\n| 491 | 1 | Veritas II - Learnable Hybrid Pooling: Mean-Max-LSE with Adaptive Fusion | Veritas II | 330 | 0.6768 | 0.8575 | 0.0507 | 0.4910 | 0.8953 | 0.9508 | 0.5511 | 0.9415 |\n| 486 | 1 | Veritas II - SOTA Re-replication (Post-Fix, Modularized): Veritas I's DSConv Hybrid Mean-Max Pool... | Veritas II | 327 | 0.6812 | 0.8569 | 0.0504 | 0.5086 | 0.8895 | 0.9517 | 0.5619 | 0.9492 |\n\nPage 1 of 56 (sorted by: author)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-56, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}`\
