    \ -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761343787904769292\n2025-10-25 06:09:47,919\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761343787919129190\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Veritas II - SOTA Re-replication (Multi-seed Run 1): Dual-Path + Task-Specific Heads (ID 552 baseline)' submitted for Research Task #1: Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling. Evaluation ID: 561. Tags truncated from 10 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research\
